  "description": {
    "about": {
      "items": [
        {
          "items": [
            "Pinkie Flamingo Welcomes You To Coastal Grove!<br>3 Kings / 2 Sets Twin Over Twin Bunks / Sleeper Sofa<br><br>“It's all happening now” said Pinkie Flamingo as she cruised past the popular Gulf Place scene on Florida's famous Highway 30A. Having evolved into more of a state-of-mind in recent years, this winding coastal avenue is composed of a diverse array of charming beach communities and quaint eclectic neighborhoods. With a collective appeal to just about everyone, each of the areas has its own unique style and affords a different vacation experience. <br><br>Pinkie especially liked the vibe around Gulf Place with its array of beachy shops and locally-owned restaurants. The open-air upstairs at Shunk Gulley was a particular favorite and Pinkie had been known to catch a sunset or two while sipping a craft cocktail overlooking the street scene below and watching the waves playfully rolling in across the way. <br><br>Marveling at the proximity to the action, Pinkie turned off County Hwy 393 down a quiet street and pulled up the gated entrance of Coastal Grove, a very inviting community of townhomes just 2 blocks from Gulf Place! Her destination today was #5 at 43 Coastal Grove Way, a popular unit just around to the left and walkable to the community pool and The Ed Walline Public Beach Access.<br><br>Here's The Layout…<br><br>Level 1<br>•\tGround floor entrance foyer<br>•\tBunk room sleeps 6 with 2 sets of twin bunks / Queen sleeper sofa<br>•\tLarge flatscreen TV<br>•\tFull bath with tub/shower<br>•\tFull-size Washer/Dryer<br>•\tAttached 1 car garage with backpack beach chairs / beach cart / beach gear<br>•\tBack deck with propane grill<br>•\tOutdoor dining for 4<br>•\t<br><br>Level 2<br>•\tOpen concept living space combining entertainment / cooking / dining<br>•\tSleek modern white & stainless kitchen with glass-top stove<br>•\tExpansive island for prep & gathering with 4 bar stools<br>•\tCozy corner dining spot with seating for 8-10<br>•\tCheery natural light wafting into living room <br>•\tHall bathroom featuring walk-in shower<br>•\tWell-appointed guest bedroom with King bed<br><br>Level 3<br>•\tDueling King master suites both equally stylish and spectacular…perfect for 2 couples sharing this vacation rental as no one gets slighted here!<br>•\tBedrooms feature King beds and attached bathrooms<br>•\tBathrooms feature tub/shower combos<br><br>Level 4<br>Let the spirit lift you higher and up the spiral stairs to the rooftop terrace where you will find the most delightful hang-out. Not one but 2 lounge seating area invite you to chill while the gentle Gulf Breezes soothe your soul. Peak-a-boo Gulf views are yours for the taking and well worth the climb.<br><br>Makin' My Way Along 30A…Gulf Place<br><br>All of Pinkie's Properties Have A Few Things In Common<br>•\tMust Be 25 To Book<br>•\tNo Smoking <br>•\tCancellation OK 30 Days Prior To Check-In<br>•\tSheets & Bath Towels Included…BYO Beach Towels<br>•\tAll Kitchens Fully-Equipped With Cooking/Eating Utensils… BYO Spices & Food<br>•\tBasic Essentials Starter Set Only…TP, Paper Towels, Trash Bags, Soaps, Etc …Depending on Length of Stay You May Need More",
            "Our prices include all fees. No hidden fees."
          ],
          "title": "🦩Book Me Baby! Coastal Grove in Santa Rosa Beach🦩"
        }
      ],
      "title": "About this property"
    },
